Now, multiply this by \( \frac{2}{\sqrt{\pi}} \sqrt{n} \):
\( \frac{2}{\sqrt{\pi}} \sqrt{n} \cdot \sqrt{\frac{\pi}{n}} = \frac{2}{\sqrt{\pi}} \cdot \sqrt{\pi} = 2 \).

